{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "story_phatom_set_1_story_1",
  "groupId": "story_phatom_set_1",
  "stageId": null,
  "title": "合作",
  "storyCode": null,
  "avgTag": "幕間",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_phatom_1_1.txt",
  "sourceHash": "fbf0346a523e4f3f5842293f7833f43958e1ce20c1526be8ef8ddb810a8dcdf2",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "羅德島本艦\n某個偏僻的角落"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "絮雨",
      "speakerId": "char_436_whispr",
      "text": "清除異物、癒合傷口、擦乾血跡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "絮雨",
      "speakerId": "char_436_whispr",
      "text": "我所能做的，只有這些。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "絮雨",
      "speakerId": "char_436_whispr",
      "text": "更精細的治療，你需要醫療部專業醫師的幫助。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傀影",
      "speakerId": "char_250_phantom",
      "text": "......這些就足夠了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傀影",
      "speakerId": "char_250_phantom",
      "text": "謝謝。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "絮雨",
      "speakerId": "char_436_whispr",
      "text": "你要到哪裡去？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傀影",
      "speakerId": "char_250_phantom",
      "text": "回我該去的地方。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "絮雨",
      "speakerId": "char_436_whispr",
      "text": "該去的地方......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "絮雨",
      "speakerId": "char_436_whispr",
      "text": "你是說......獨自一個人的地方？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "絮雨",
      "speakerId": "char_436_whispr",
      "text": "你、你不去和小隊的人一起慶祝嗎？你們這次的任務很重要，他們都很高興，你也可以一起......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傀影",
      "speakerId": "char_250_phantom",
      "text": "不必了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傀影",
      "speakerId": "char_250_phantom",
      "text": "慶祝的時刻不必有我。正午的陽光下不必有陰影。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傀影",
      "speakerId": "char_250_phantom",
      "text": "或許該去參加慶祝的是你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "絮雨",
      "speakerId": "char_436_whispr",
      "text": "這......我不......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傀影",
      "speakerId": "char_250_phantom",
      "text": "請隨意。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傀影",
      "speakerId": "char_250_phantom",
      "text": "......我該離開了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "char_250_phantom",
      "text": "——給我慢著！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞葉",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "text": "總算找到你了，傀影幹員！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞葉",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "text": "絮雨醫師，您之前是在幫他處理傷口嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "絮雨",
      "speakerId": "char_436_whispr",
      "text": "啊......嗯......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞葉",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "text": "雖然您不是正式編制的醫療部醫師，但我還是有責任提醒您。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞葉",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "text": "根據《羅德島傷患管理與治療條例》上的章程，所有受傷幹員必須在羅德島醫療部進行登記。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞葉",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "text": "像您這樣私下為幹員治療傷口，小傷小病也就算了，萬一傀影幹員因為您的不完全治療導致任何併發症或傷口惡化，醫療部會很頭疼的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "絮雨",
      "speakerId": "char_436_whispr",
      "text": "很對不起......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傀影",
      "speakerId": "char_250_phantom",
      "text": "要求絮雨小姐進行治療的是我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傀影",
      "speakerId": "char_250_phantom",
      "text": "沒有非難她的必要。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞葉",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "text": "我只是向她陳述事實。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞葉",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "text": "至於你，傀影幹員，你的問題更嚴重！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞葉",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "text": "受傷之後為什麼不來醫療部報到？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傀影",
      "speakerId": "char_250_phantom",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞葉",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "text": "如果不是與你一同參加外勤任務的藍毒小姐在接受治療時向我報告了你的情況，你是不是想把這傷痛帶到下一場戰鬥中去？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞葉",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "text": "這是對羅德島的不負責，也是對你自己的不負責。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞葉",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "text": "希望你能瞭解到這點。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傀影",
      "speakerId": "char_250_phantom",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傀影",
      "speakerId": "char_250_phantom",
      "text": "是我的過錯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傀影",
      "speakerId": "char_250_phantom",
      "text": "我向您致歉，醫生。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞葉",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "text": "好，我接受你的道歉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞葉",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "text": "現在，我要對你進行診療以全面確認你的身體狀況，可以吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傀影",
      "speakerId": "char_250_phantom",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞葉",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "text": "別擺出那副表情，等等，別開口，不許出聲，別想用你的源石技藝溜走！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞葉",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "text": "我是不會再上一次當的，只要我認知到半點不對勁我就立刻按這個警報按鈕！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "絮雨",
      "speakerId": "char_436_whispr",
      "text": "牆壁上原來還有這種按鈕嗎......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞葉",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "text": "放輕鬆，我沒有要帶著你走過大廳然後進入醫療部的意思。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞葉",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "text": "藍毒小姐和我說了，你不喜歡人多的地方。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞葉",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "text": "所以我把設備都帶來了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞葉",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "text": "我會幫你進行醫療資訊的收集和整理，然後和絮雨醫師一起為你處理傷口。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞葉",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "text": "可以吧，絮雨醫師。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "絮雨",
      "speakerId": "char_436_whispr",
      "text": "當然。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞葉",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "text": "那您認可嗎，傀影幹員？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傀影",
      "speakerId": "char_250_phantom",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傀影",
      "speakerId": "char_250_phantom",
      "text": "（歎氣）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傀影",
      "speakerId": "char_250_phantom",
      "text": "（默默頷首）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞葉",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "text": "好，那我立刻為你進行診療。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞葉",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "text": "如果可以的話，能為我描述傷口位置和大致情況嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傀影",
      "speakerId": "char_250_phantom",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞葉",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "text": "為什麼不說話？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傀影",
      "speakerId": "char_250_phantom",
      "text": "（指指抿起的嘴巴）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "絮雨",
      "speakerId": "char_436_whispr",
      "text": "我想，是因為亞葉小姐剛才說，不許開口。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞葉",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "text": "（白眼）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞葉",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "text": "現在可以了，請說吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傀影",
      "speakerId": "char_250_phantom",
      "text": "......弩箭刺穿肩膀、利刃劃過手掌、寒冰束縛雙足。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞葉",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "text": "肩膀，刺穿傷；利器對手部造成傷害；低溫......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "絮雨",
      "speakerId": "char_436_whispr",
      "text": "右腿沒受什麼影響，但左小腿好像沒完全恢復。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞葉",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "text": "好，我們一個一個來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞葉",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "text": "肩膀刺穿傷。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "絮雨",
      "speakerId": "char_436_whispr",
      "text": "剛剛為他做了傷口癒合，應該沒有什麼大礙。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞葉",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "text": "唔......如果只是普通的金屬箭矢倒還好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞葉",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "text": "清創做了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "絮雨",
      "speakerId": "char_436_whispr",
      "text": "已經處理了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞葉",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "text": "從癒合情況上來看應該不存在中毒或者感染的可能性。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞葉",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "text": "好，下一個位置。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞葉",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "text": "掌心割裂傷。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞葉",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "text": "嗯，癒合得很好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞葉",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "text": "但是，身上受到兩處外傷，創口感染的可能性也會大幅提升，一會我會為你打預防針，這樣感染方面的問題就不用擔心了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞葉",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "text": "最後，左小腿凍傷。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞葉",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "text": "沒事的，你就這樣別動，我帶了專門的檢測儀器。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞葉",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "text": "可能會有點痛，請忍一忍。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傀影",
      "speakerId": "char_250_phantom",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "樣本已採集\n分析開始——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞葉",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "text": "好了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞葉",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "text": "等資料出來，我就可以下最終的診斷決定。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞葉",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "text": "還有其他不適或受傷的部位嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傀影",
      "speakerId": "char_250_phantom",
      "text": "（嗯？）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傀影",
      "speakerId": "char_250_phantom",
      "text": "（Miss.Christine？好像叼著什麼......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞葉",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "text": "——你在聽我說話嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傀影",
      "speakerId": "char_250_phantom",
      "text": "......嗯。沒有，沒有其他傷。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞葉",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "text": "好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞葉",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "text": "傀影幹員的恢復能力的確很出眾。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞葉",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "text": "有可能真的是我過慮了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞葉",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "text": "傀影幹——傀影先生是特種幹員吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傀影",
      "speakerId": "char_250_phantom",
      "text": "他們是這樣喊的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞葉",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "text": "但你身上的這幾種傷口類型，我在先鋒和重裝幹員身上見的比較多。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傀影",
      "speakerId": "char_250_phantom",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞葉",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "text": "聽說你們這次的任務很艱難。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞葉",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "text": "“幸虧有他的支援，我們才能活著回來。”這樣的話，我已經從許多人口中聽到了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞葉",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "text": "但他們大多不知道你的代號，甚至都沒有見過你的模樣，只知道在戰場上閃過的影子幫了他們一把。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傀影",
      "speakerId": "char_250_phantom",
      "text": "記住我對他們沒有好處。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞葉",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "text": "這話我聽膩了。我治療過的部分幹員總喜歡強調這一點。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞葉",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "text": "我們不說這個，別扯太多有的沒的。在這裡的人大多數都沒那麼天真，或許哪一天我們會分道揚鑣，搞不好哪天真的就兵戎相見。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞葉",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "text": "但傀影先生，就算是我多管閒事......我覺得我得告訴你，至少在現在，他們只是想表達自己的感激之情，僅此而已。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞葉",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "text": "有些話，如果在能說的時候不說給別人聽，之後或許就再也沒有機會了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞葉",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "text": "（輕聲）......別像我一樣蠢，把事情都憋在心裡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傀影",
      "speakerId": "char_250_phantom",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞葉",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "text": "藍毒說，你幫她擋下了一支弩箭。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞葉",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "text": "她想感謝你，但卻找不到你，所以托我帶了些東西過來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞葉",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "text": "這枚胸針，是她贈送給你的禮物，請你收下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傀影",
      "speakerId": "char_250_phantom",
      "text": "這個......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞葉",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "text": "收下吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傀影",
      "speakerId": "char_250_phantom",
      "text": "......多謝。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傀影",
      "speakerId": "char_250_phantom",
      "text": "我會向她傳達我的謝意。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "分析已結束\n正在輸出分析報告"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞葉",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "text": "嗯......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞葉",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "text": "情況不妙。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞葉",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "text": "傀影先生，你能嘗試活動一下嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傀影",
      "speakerId": "char_250_phantom",
      "text": "（略微不協調地走動）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞葉",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "text": "好，足夠了，請先坐下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞葉",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "text": "應該是源石技藝造成溫度驟降後導致的凍傷。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞葉",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "text": "雖然不嚴重，但已經影響到你行動了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傀影",
      "speakerId": "char_250_phantom",
      "text": "只是些小傷。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞葉",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "text": "對於病痛的鑑別，請以醫療人士的專業意見作為參考，謝謝。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "絮雨",
      "speakerId": "char_436_whispr",
      "text": "傀影先生近期最好靜養。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "絮雨",
      "speakerId": "char_436_whispr",
      "text": "這是我的意見。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞葉",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "text": "我同意絮雨醫師的觀點。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞葉",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "text": "表面上是凍傷，但實質上還是源石技藝致傷。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞葉",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "text": "你的感染狀況本就不容樂觀，對於一切可能增加你感染進程的情況，我們都要盡力避免。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞葉",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "text": "充分休息，健康飲食，進行適當的修復性運動，這是你現在所需要做的事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞葉",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "text": "當然，最重要的，還是定期來醫療部接受治療。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞葉",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "text": "療程不會太長，只要一個月，你就能重新參加任務。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞葉",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "text": "如果你不喜歡來醫療部，我可以幫你安排巡診，減少你和他人的接觸。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傀影",
      "speakerId": "char_250_phantom",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞葉",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "text": "如果同意的話，請在這份告知書最末尾簽字。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傀影",
      "speakerId": "char_250_phantom",
      "text": "（再次歎氣）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傀影",
      "speakerId": "char_250_phantom",
      "text": "（簽上了自己的代號）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞葉",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "text": "好，謝謝合作。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞葉",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "text": "現在該給您打針了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞葉",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "text": "這是新式的注射器，不會產生太多疼痛感的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞葉",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "text": "請把手伸出來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傀影",
      "speakerId": "char_250_phantom",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞葉",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "text": "（使用注射器）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞葉",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "text": "好，這樣前期的預防治療算是大功告成。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞葉",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "text": "我下午還有會議，就不繼續打擾你們了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞葉",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "text": "請好好享受一個月的假期，傀影先生。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞葉",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "text": "再見。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "絮雨",
      "speakerId": "char_436_whispr",
      "text": "她離開了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "絮雨",
      "speakerId": "char_436_whispr",
      "text": "呼......我還是不太習慣和亞葉小姐搭話，總是會緊張......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "絮雨",
      "speakerId": "char_436_whispr",
      "text": "你還好嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傀影",
      "speakerId": "char_250_phantom",
      "text": "沒什麼問題。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Miss.Christine",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_130",
      "text": "喵。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傀影",
      "speakerId": "char_250_phantom",
      "text": "Miss.Christine。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Miss.Christine",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_130",
      "text": "（蹭了蹭傀影。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傀影",
      "speakerId": "char_250_phantom",
      "text": "別鬧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "絮雨",
      "speakerId": "char_436_whispr",
      "text": "接下來的假期，就請傀影先生好好休息吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傀影",
      "speakerId": "char_250_phantom",
      "text": "假期？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傀影",
      "speakerId": "char_250_phantom",
      "text": "我從來沒有想過。假期，該做什麼......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "絮雨",
      "speakerId": "char_436_whispr",
      "text": "唔，比如......觀影?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "絮雨",
      "speakerId": "char_436_whispr",
      "text": "如果是我，我會去看一場電影，然後將那時的心情記錄下來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "絮雨",
      "speakerId": "char_436_whispr",
      "text": "那時候，我總會幻想自己像影片中的人那樣生活，同時，又能矛盾地感覺到自己真實地在螢幕外呼吸......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傀影",
      "speakerId": "char_250_phantom",
      "text": "......當心。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傀影",
      "speakerId": "char_250_phantom",
      "text": "幻想去過別人的生活，並不是一件好事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "絮雨",
      "speakerId": "char_436_whispr",
      "text": "我明白，只是，這是我習慣的放鬆方式。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "絮雨",
      "speakerId": "char_436_whispr",
      "text": "而且......這麼說有些不好意思，只是好像有一些幹員，很喜歡讀我寫下來的那些東西......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "絮雨",
      "speakerId": "char_436_whispr",
      "text": "雖然我並不認為自己寫得很好，但如果大家能夠喜歡的話，我覺得這樣也不壞。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傀影",
      "speakerId": "char_250_phantom",
      "text": "這樣......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Miss.Christine",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_130",
      "text": "喵——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傀影",
      "speakerId": "char_250_phantom",
      "text": "Miss.Christine？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傀影",
      "speakerId": "char_250_phantom",
      "text": "很癢，不要這樣......嗯？這是什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "絮雨",
      "speakerId": "char_436_whispr",
      "text": "我猜，她可能是想讓您看看這張傳單。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傀影",
      "speakerId": "char_250_phantom",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傀影",
      "speakerId": "char_250_phantom",
      "text": "“多媒體密室項目誠徵工作人員數名——”"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傀影",
      "speakerId": "char_250_phantom",
      "text": "“需要相關人員負責設計密室整體緊迫而壓抑的探險氛圍。”"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傀影",
      "speakerId": "char_250_phantom",
      "text": "“需要相關人員設計密室中的解密與機關。”"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傀影",
      "speakerId": "char_250_phantom",
      "text": "“需要相關人員——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傀影",
      "speakerId": "char_250_phantom",
      "text": "——進行扮演。”"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傀影",
      "speakerId": "char_250_phantom",
      "text": "“企劃及營運為期一個月。期間支付薪資，包一日三餐。”"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傀影",
      "speakerId": "char_250_phantom",
      "text": "“有興趣的幹員和留島人員請至人事部詳談。”"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傀影",
      "speakerId": "char_250_phantom",
      "text": "多媒體密室......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "絮雨",
      "speakerId": "char_436_whispr",
      "text": "聽說是一種強調感官刺激和浸入式體驗的新型娛樂方式。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "絮雨",
      "speakerId": "char_436_whispr",
      "text": "好像......大部分密室主題都以恐怖與懸疑為主要元素。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "絮雨",
      "speakerId": "char_436_whispr",
      "text": "前一段時間還見到過一次，當時的主題是米諾斯的地下迷宮。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "絮雨",
      "speakerId": "char_436_whispr",
      "text": "我其實很想去試試看。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "絮雨",
      "speakerId": "char_436_whispr",
      "text": "但是那一天A1小隊的幹員體驗完畢後和我說——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "絮雨",
      "speakerId": "char_436_whispr",
      "text": "“嚇死我了！”"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "絮雨",
      "speakerId": "char_436_whispr",
      "text": "可是，她們說這話的時候看上去很開心。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傀影",
      "speakerId": "char_250_phantom",
      "text": "（恐懼，但卻喜悅？）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傀影",
      "speakerId": "char_250_phantom",
      "text": "（唔......喜歡受到驚嚇？）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "絮雨",
      "speakerId": "char_436_whispr",
      "text": "我當時不敢去，現在想起來，又有點後悔......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "絮雨",
      "speakerId": "char_436_whispr",
      "text": "這次或許我可以，呃，請求溫蒂和我一起去？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傀影",
      "speakerId": "char_250_phantom",
      "text": "Miss.Christine，你希望我看到這個嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Miss.Christine",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_130",
      "text": "喵！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傀影",
      "speakerId": "char_250_phantom",
      "text": "唔......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傀影",
      "speakerId": "char_250_phantom",
      "text": "我想我明白你的意思了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "絮雨",
      "speakerId": "char_436_whispr",
      "text": "您要離開了？那，您想好假期的去處了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傀影",
      "speakerId": "char_250_phantom",
      "text": "只是有些想法。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傀影",
      "speakerId": "char_250_phantom",
      "text": "如果適量的恐懼能為別人帶去快樂。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傀影",
      "speakerId": "char_250_phantom",
      "text": "或許......我可以嘗試。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
